  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.37 with immutable ProGPU preview.43; consumes optimized retained canvas-state routing and typed bitmap-flush clip rebasing without adding a bridge workaround; retains typed native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, X11 transparent visuals, bounded weak render-resource caches, retained-scene disposal, static-frame render suppression, and typed memory ownership; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
